WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.557
Today we will compose a simple shared musical phrase. Our work connects with other

00:00:05.557 --> 00:00:06.323
Ghanaian communities.

00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:10.677
Write or say a short call about caring for people or places.

00:00:11.533 --> 00:00:14.115
Invent an easy response of similar length.

00:00:15.533 --> 00:00:20.248
Practise taking turns as leader and responding group. Compare your result with a

00:00:20.248 --> 00:00:21.699
second example from Ghana.
